  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK revision  av RFSU 2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Controll Review ISK of RFSU 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RFSU is expected in 2023 to submit an application for a five-year grant for the period 2024-2029. In order for Sida / CIVSAM to get a better picture of the organization&apos;s system for internal governance and control, a call from the framework agreement on auditing services has been implemented for conducting an ISK review.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RFSU v&#xE4;ntas &#xE5;r 2023 inkomma med en ans&#xF6;kan om ett fem&#xE5;rigt st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r perioden 2024-2029. F&#xF6;r att Sida/CIVSAM ska f&#xE5; en b&#xE4;ttre bild av organisationens system f&#xF6;r intern styrning och kontroll har ett avrop fr&#xE5;n ramavtalet om revisionstj&#xE4;nster genomf&#xF6;rts f&#xF6;r genomf&#xF6;rande av en ISK-granskning.</narrative>
  </description>
